  ^{:line 83} [^{:val 25 :doc "The store (doc/LISP-SANDBOX.md, *The store*): the box's data, kept by\nthe monitor in a directory of the host's it is given\n(WHIM_GUEST_STORE; Arbace's launcher: ARBACE_BOX_STORE), so that no\ndata need be built into an image.\nBlobs are immutable and named by their SHA-256; refs are names a\nguest gives a blob, the store's only mutable state.  Not host\nfunctions: answered by the monitor, not serialised with the others.\nWithout a store every call answers StoreNone; the other failures are\nthe Store* answers below (go-whim's guests take any as -1's).\n\nBlobPut stores a[1] bytes at a[0] and writes their SHA-256 to the 32\nbytes at a[2]: ret 0, -1, or StoreTooLarge beyond the store's limit.\n"} BlobPut]


